अभिमृष्ट p. p.
—1 Touched, rubbed or stroked gently;
—2 Brought close to, grazing.

अभिमेथिक + .{@-मेथिका@}
—1 Use of words or language calculated to secure every thing (सर्वप्राप्तिसाधनो वाग्भेदः).
—2 Abusive speech, obscene expression; an imprecation.

अभियातृ, -यातिन् a.
 approaching, assailing, encountering; assailant;
 रामाभियायिनां तेषाम् R. 12. 43.

